### Catalogue Service API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/health

###

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products

###

### Get Active Products Only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/active

###

### Get Product by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/1

###

### Search Products by Keyword
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/search?keyword=laptop

###

### Get Products by Category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/category/Electronics

###

### Get Products by Seller ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/seller/1

###

### Get Products by Price Range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/price-range?min=100&max=1000

###

### Create New Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "description": "A test product for demonstration",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "startingPrice": 100.00,
  "reservePrice": 200.00,
  "sellerId": 1,
  "endDate": "2026-04-01T12:00:00",
  "shippingCost": 15.00,
  "keywords": "test, sample, demo",
  "condition": "NEW",
  "quantity": 1,
  "auctionType": "English Auction"
}

###

### Update Product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Product Name",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "startingPrice": 850.00
}

###

### Activate Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/1/activate

###

### Deactivate Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/1/deactivate

###

### Update Product Status (for Auction Service integration)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_AUCTION"
}

###

### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/catalogue/products/6

###
